     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Spelling and phone numbers",
     "texto": [
      "To ask someone to spell their name, we use «Hoe spel je je naam?» (How do you spell your name?). When giving a phone number, we say «Mijn nummer is...» and list the digits one by one: nul, één, twee, drie, vier, vijf, zes, zeven, acht, negen, tien."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
